<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kirchmann-Hurry raises H1 shr, div.</title>
<headline>Kirchmann-Hurry raises H1 shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, per combined unit (cts)  32.30	 vs    29.80</p>
<p>    Distribution (cts)		32.25	 vs    29.50</p>
<p>    Attrib income			0.03	 vs    0.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax				0.03	 vs    0.16</p>
<p>    Interest paid			1.32	 vs    2.62</p>
<p>    Turnover			    15.77	 vs    14.31</p>
<p>Div payable June 6</p>
<p>on register May 23</p>
<p>Full name: Kirchmann-Hurry Properties Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was confident earnings for the next financial period would grow.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
